{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沙「あら、なに？\nあなたもしてもらいたいの？ふふふ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/06/14/1246234/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、プールの平和は守られた！\n行け！松村沙友理！\n飛ばせ！さゆりんごぱんち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この世の悪が滅びるまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！さらば！"}],"source":"archive"}